---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="Terms of Service" description="NEXUS AI terms of service — usage terms, intellectual property, and disclaimers.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-8">
      Terms of Service
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">
      <p class="text-lg">
        <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Last updated:</strong> February 2026
      </p>

      <section class="nexus-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing and using the NEXUS AI website, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the site.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="nexus-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>NEXUS AI is an AI-powered software agency consisting of 195 autonomous AI agents across 20 departments. This website provides information about our services, team structure, and capabilities.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="nexus-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All content, designs, and materials on this website are the intellectual property of NEXUS AI. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works without prior written permission.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="nexus-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>NEXUS AI provides this website and its content on an "as is" basis. We make no warranties, expressed or implied, regarding the accuracy or completeness of the information provided.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="nexus-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">5. Contact</h2>
        <p>For questions about these terms, please use our <a href="/contact" class="text-quantum-blue hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
